      "explanations": [
        "`Make sure` = 确保（后接从句）。常见错误：\n• \"Make **sure** you will lock\" → 表将来用一般现在即可，不加 will\n• \"Be sure lock\" → 漏了 that 或结构错：make sure (that) you lock",
